  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {申請|しんせい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to apply, to file an application)\n- ⟦{申請|しんせい}{書|しょ}→申請書：07486_shinseisho⟧ (application form)\n- {申請|しんせい}⟦{手続|てつづ}き→手続き：05453_tetsuzuki⟧ (application procedure)\n- {申請|しんせい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}け{付|つ}ける→受け付ける：05683_uketsukeru⟧ (to accept applications)\n- {申請|しんせい}⟦{中|ちゅう}→〜中：09840_chuu⟧ (application pending)\n\nTYPES:\n- ⟦ビザ→ビザ：08283_biza⟧{申請|しんせい} (visa application)\n- ⟦{許可|きょか}→許可：00259_kyoka⟧{申請|しんせい} (permit application)\n- ⟦{補助金|ほじょきん}→補助金：19222_hojokin⟧{申請|しんせい} (subsidy application)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{申|もう}し{込|こ}み→申し込み：03161_moushikomi⟧ - application (less formal, for services/events)\n- ⟦{願書|がんしょ}→願書：16223_gansho⟧ - application form (especially for school admission)\n- ⟦{届|とど}け{出|で}→届出：07555_todokede⟧ - notification, report (required filing)",
